From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 19:57:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add My Media: a Google Drive video library at /mymedia/

Lists the configured Drive folder (subfolders, pagination, yt-dlp names,
subtitle and thumbnail sidecars) and plays each file with the browser's
own player, falling back to Astra's compatibility and software decoders
for formats Chrome rejects. Watch progress, resume, Continue watching,
search, sort, speed, subtitles, picture in picture and lock-screen
controls. Adds the launcher entry, the /mymedia* CSP and docs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
